		<unit label="chapter" identifier="12" level="4">Permits for Certain Mining Operations; Reclamation of Land</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="4" level="5">Minerals Reclamation Fund</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>45.2-1242</section_number>
	<catch_line> Discontinuance of Fund</catch_line>
	<text>
		If the Fund is discontinued, any amounts remaining in the Fund shall be returned to the members in proportion to the amount that each member has paid.
	</text>
	<history>1978, c. 634, § 45.1-197.16; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
